{"id": "EUVD-2026-81056", "enisaUuid": "035c39a5-52dc-3ab7-bdbc-dc5a451814bf", "description": "GoAdmin through 1.2.26 fails to properly anchor the logout pattern when checking permissions, allowing authenticated users to bypass permission checks by appending a query parameter. Attackers can append a query string containing the admin prefix followed by /logout to reach administrative endpoints and perform unauthorized actions including reading sensitive data and modifying application state.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T20:32:48", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-17T13:46:48", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/GoAdminGroup/go-admin/issues/690", "https://github.com/GoAdminGroup/go-admin", "https://github.com/GoAdminGroup/go-admin/blob/v1.2.26/plugins/admin/models/user.go#L129-L133", "https://github.com/GoAdminGroup/go-admin/blob/v1.2.26/modules/auth/middleware.go#L177", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/goadmin-through-1.2.26-authorization-bypass-via-query-parameter"], "aliases": ["GHSA-p5vv-57h4-97rx", "CVE-2026-92793"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.45, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "7206e291-37a1-3a60-9f9b-4697ef33b5b9", "product": {"name": "go-admin", "vendor": {"name": "GoAdminGroup"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.2.26"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "df2d766e-3ea2-340b-b6d4-67b87aeed836", "vendor": {"name": "GoAdminGroup"}}], "isExploited": false}